Server init.
>> a := Blob bago: 4.
a bytes: ( Listahan bago ; Bin b00000101 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000001 ; 0).
>> b := Blob bago: 4.
b bytes: ( Listahan bago ; Bin b00000110 ; Hx x0A ; Bin b10000000 ; 0).
# inherited blob does not get the buffer, so it's useless
# it will pass ctr_accept() but since buffer ptr == null, it will retur
>> c := a bago.
{ 
>> n := a ^ c.
Labas isulat: ['xorred:'], bagong-linya. 
Labas isulat: n, bagong-linya. 
} saluhin: { :e Labas isulat: e, bagong-linya. }, patakbuhin.
a palayain.
b palayain.
